From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bjarne <87858321+bjakra@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 14:41:40 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] SystemUI: hide Graphite Now Playing's background service
 notification

Android raises a blocked foreground service channel back to low importance, so the service can't
hide its notification itself. A notification filter hides only that channel of org.graphite.nowplaying.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
